<title>USA: Ansan,Titan sign letter of intent.</title>
<headline>Ansan,Titan sign letter of intent.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO, Calif 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ansan Pharmaceuticals Inc and Titan Pharmaceuticals Inc said they signed a letter of intent between providing for Titan to invest up to $8 million in Ansan over the next two years.</p>
<p>The investment will consist of $500,000 for 125,000 shares of Ansan's common stock at $4.00 per share and $1.5 million in a two-year promissory note convertible into common stock.</p>
<p>Titan is Ansan's largest shareholder, and owns about 43 percent of Ansan's currently outstanding common stock.</p>
</text>
